[ti:Excuse Me!]
[by:更多学习内容，请到VeryCD.com搜索“露珠”]

[00:00.61]Lesson 1 | 第1课
[00:02.71]Excuse me! | 请问!
[00:05.61]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音,然后回答这个问题。
[00:10.80]Whose handbag is it? | 这是谁的手提包?
[00:15.11]Excuse me! | 请问!
[00:16.66]Yes? | 什么事?
[00:18.26]Is this your handbag? | 这是您的手提包吗?
[00:21.44]Pardon? | 请再说一遍?
[00:23.17]Is this your handbag? | 这是您的手提包吗?
[00:26.73]Yes it is. | 是的,是我的。
[00:29.49]Thank you very much. | 非常感谢。